<title>USA: Health Care REIT names Braun to position.</title>
<headline>Health Care REIT names Braun to position.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said on Tuesday that Raymond Braun, vice president, has been appointed to the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Health Care REIT is a real estate investment trust which invests in health care facilities, primarily nursing homes, assisted living facilities and retirement centers.</p>
